# Local runtime storage: graph volumes, raw capture, checkpoints, DLQ,
# backups, exports, and downloaded models. Keep config and fixtures trackable.
# .eoip-data/ is the documented local EOIP_DATA_DIR (README quick start).
/.eoip-data/
/.cache/
/runtime/
/volumes/
/deploy/volumes/
/raw/
/state/
/checkpoints/
/dlq/
/backups/
/exports/
/model-cache/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
# packages/eoip/models/ is source code and must remain trackable.

# QA bench run artifacts (sandbox data, probe results, failure screenshots);
